-- IQ POS — four test businesses (Restaurant, Cafe, Retail, Wholesale), 2026-11-13.
-- Run on the live Turso database (no schema change). Creates: Test Restaurant, Test Cafe, Test Retail Shop,
-- Test Wholesale — each with an admin, an accounts login and a staff login (with Till/Kitchen PIN), a small
-- menu / product list, and (restaurant + cafe) tables; plus one regional admin who can manage all four.
-- Every row uses INSERT OR IGNORE, so running it twice changes nothing. Remove them again with:
--   DELETE FROM restaurants WHERE name LIKE 'Test %';  (everything under them cascades)
--   DELETE FROM users WHERE email = 'regional@test-iq.example';

